OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA few
OL,6,Fshowers lingering otherwise dry with
OL,7,Fclear spells, feeling quite chilly.
OL,8,FTurning cloudier later in the evening
OL,9,Fwith rain spreading northeast later in
OL,10,Fthe night.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FA wet start for most areas,
OL,13,Frain will be heavy and persistent for
OL,14,Fa time, turning lighter for western
OL,15,Fareas by lunchtime and likely a dry
OL,16,Fand bright afternoon here.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
