OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FRather
OL,6,Funsettled over the weekend, rain and
OL,7,Fstrong winds spread east Saturday
OL,8,Fmorning. showery later and through
OL,9,FSunday accompanied by severe gales.
OL,10,FBrighter morning Monday, but wet and
OL,11,Fwindy later.
